# No environment variables are required for local development.
#
# This app uses Open-Meteo (https://open-meteo.com), a free weather API
# that requires no API key or account registration.
#
# --- Optional: production / split deploy ---
#
# NestJS API (Railway):
#   PORT=3000
#   CORS_ORIGINS=https://weather-forecast-strip.netlify.app,http://localhost:5173
#
# Vite frontend (Netlify) — must include https://, no trailing slash:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://weather-app-challenge-production.up.railway.app
#
# If you later switch to a keyed API (e.g. OpenWeatherMap), add it here:
# WEATHER_API_KEY=your_key_here
